Subject: [PATCH] Phase 3 part 1: reputation, calendars, automations; delete
 contacts

Reputation: review sites, reviews (manual and CSV import), reply drafts
that a person posts, complaint tasks for 1-2 star reviews, an explained
0-100 health score, and review requests whose public page always offers
every review site (no gating).

Calendars: personal, round-robin and resource calendars with hours,
buffers, notice and limits; double booking blocked by an exclusion
constraint; public booking with recorded SMS consent; customer
reschedule/cancel links; confirmations and reminders.

Automations: domain-event outbox, immutable versioned workflows that
only managers switch on, templates, "describe it in English" drafts,
compliance-gated messages, signed webhooks, leased runs with step logs,
run via /api/jobs/tick from the existing scheduler.

AI operator gains reputation, calendar and automation tools and a new
Appointments permission. CRM contacts can now be deleted (managers, one
or up to 100 at a time); opt-outs survive deletion.

